ed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":19,"created_at":"2025-09-21T19:24:11Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T19:31:27Z","closed_at":"2025-09-26T18:53:09Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.5.stable\n_Not_ reproducible in 4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7652) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10700F CPU @ 2.90GHz (16 threads) - 15.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using Jolt physics, `RigidBody3D` nodes that have CCD (continuous collision detection) enabled may generate native errors in the console when they collide (it is pretty random, sometimes not generating any errors on a collision, but sometimes generating multiple per collision). But it is always _on a collision_, not passively.\n\n<img width=\"677\" height=\"366\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c92b27f-7e06-4603-8742-878f81728e2f\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI don't have a reliable repro outside of my own project which is huge.\n\nWhat is known so far:\n- error only occurs during collisions\n- occurrence and number of errors is probabilistic\n- setting `continuous_cd` to `false` makes the error go away\n- setting `max_contacts_reported` to `0` makes the error go away\n- using the old Godot physics makes the error go away\n- setting `contact_monitor` to `false` makes no difference\n- using all default settings (in 3D, Common, and Jolt sections) does not make a difference\n\nI'm hoping these clues will be at least somewhat helpful in ringing a bell, but I will update with more details if I find any.🙏\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110757/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}